Error [E0202]: The write-access marker `&` needs a place after it
  --> sigil_write_capability_misuse.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     edit(&(1 + 2))
    |           ^
 Why: Write access reaches only a place: a name, optionally followed by field, index, or range projections such as `buf.items[0]`; a temporary expression has no storage for the edit to land in
 Fix: Bind the value first: `x := ...` then pass `&x` with the write-access marker `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
